{"id":"5984fe30-eef8-4ec8-81fe-00ff33cb81e7","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:23:10.915Z","batchId":"onboarding_nemotron-3-5-lightning-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"nemotron-3.5-lightning-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"row between gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"badge badge-outline\">Step 1: Account</div>\n    <div class=\"badge badge-outline\">Step 2: Preferences</div>\n    <div class=\"badge badge-outline\">Step 3: Done</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Onboarding Wizard</div>\n    <div class=\"card-desc\">Help us set up your account and preferences.</div>\n    <section id=\"step-1\" class=\"step\">\n      <h4>Account</h4>\n      <label class=\"label\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Full Name\" required></label>\n      <label class=\"label\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required></label>\n      <label class=\"label\"><input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Create a password\" required></label>\n      <small class=\"muted\">We'll keep your email private.</small>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"step-2\" class=\"step\">\n      <h4>Preferences</h4>\n      <label class=\"label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Receive platform updates</label>\n      <label class=\"label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Enable email notifications</label>\n      <small class=\"muted\">Change anytime in settings.</small>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"step-3\" class=\"step\">\n      <h4>Done</h4>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Your account is ready. You can now explore the platform.</p>\n      <ul class=\"list\">\n        <li>Use your email to log in</li>\n        <li>Manage preferences anytime</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary prev\">Back</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline next\">Next >> </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    const badges = document.querySelectorAll('.badge');\n    const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.step');\n    const prev = document.querySelector('.prev');\n    const next = document.querySelector('.next');\n    let idx = 0;\n    const total = steps.length;\n    function update() {\n      badges.forEach((b, i) => b.classList.toggle('active', i === idx));\n      steps.forEach((s, i) => { s.classList.toggle('active', i === idx); s.style.display = i === idx ? 'block' : 'none'; });\n      prev.disabled = idx === 0;\n      next.innerText = idx === total - 1 ? 'Finish' : 'Next >>';\n    }\n    prev.addEventListener('click', () => { if (idx > 0) { idx--; update(); } });\n    next.addEventListener('click', () => { if (idx < total - 1) { idx++; update(); } });\n    update();\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[24582,"<div"],[24582," class"],[24582,"=\""],[24582,"page"],[24582,"\">\n"],[24582," "],[24600," "],[24600,"<div"],[24600," class"],[24600,"=\""],[24622,"row"],[24622," between"],[24622," gap"],[24622,"-lg"],[24622,"\">\n"],[24622,"   "],[24622," "],[24622,"<div"],[24622," class"],[24622,"=\""],[24625,"badge"],[24625," badge"],[24625,"-outline"],[24625,"\">"],[24630,"Step"],[24630," "],[24630,"1"],[24630,":"],[24630," Account"],[24630,"</div"],[24630,">\n"],[24630,"   "],[24630," "],[24630,"<div"],[24630," class"],[24665,"=\""],[24665,"badge"],[24665," badge"],[24665,"-outline"],[